{
  "storyId": "71931b00ecfa",
  "shareUrl": "https://gemini.google.com/share/71931b00ecfa",
  "storyName": "Mormântul pecetluit",
  "folder": "stories/71931b00ecfa",
  "storyTitleAudioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/title.mp3",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "page": 0,
      "text": "Mormântul pecetluit",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-1.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Şi erau acolo multe femei, privind de departe, care urmaseră din Galileea pe Iisus, slujindu-I, între care era Maria Magdalena şi Maria, mama lui Iacov şi a lui Iosi, şi mama fiilor lui Zevedeu.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-2.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Iar făcându-se seară, a venit un om bogat din Arimateea, cu numele Iosif, care şi el era un ucenic al lui Iisus.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-3.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Acesta, ducându-se la Pilat, a cerut trupul lui Iisus.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-4.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 4,
      "text": "Atunci Pilat a poruncit să i se dea trupul lui Iisus lui Iosif.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-5.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 5,
      "text": "Şi Iosif, luând trupul, l-a înfăşurat în giulgiu curat de in.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-6.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 6,
      "text": "Şi l-a pus în mormântul nou al său, pe care-l săpase în stâncă, şi, prăvălind o piatră mare la uşa mormântului, s-a dus.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-7.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 7,
      "text": "Iar acolo era Maria Magdalena şi cealaltă Marie, şezând în faţa mormântului.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-8.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 8,
      "text": "Iar a doua zi, care este după vineri, s-au adunat arhiereii şi fariseii la Pilat, zicând: Doamne, ne-am adus aminte că amăgitorul Acela a spus, fiind încă în viaţă: După trei zile Mă voi scula.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-9.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 9,
      "text": "Pilat le-a zis: Aveţi strajă; mergeţi şi întăriţi cum ştiţi.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-10.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "page": 10,
      "text": "Iar ei, ducându-se, au întărit mormântul cu strajă, pecetluind piatra.",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/images/page-11.png",
      "audioUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ctalau/stories/main/stories/71931b00ecfa/audio/page-11.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "createdAt": "2026-04-14T17:48:52.442Z"
}